Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If my ninja gone, Duke has\Nme on the defensive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.03,0:01:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to find a way to\Nprotect my heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.95,0:01:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've rolled a movement crest\Nwith a double movement bonus, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use it to position my knight of twin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,swords between your monsters\Nand my heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.51,0:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But none of your monsters can withstand\Nthe force of Orgoth the Relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth, advance four spaces!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.15,0:01:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's heading right for the Warp Vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If Orgoth warps, Duke will get\Nthrough my defenses without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.07,0:01:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how you used the Warp\NVortex to sneak behind my lines?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Duke can play in that game! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.39,0:01:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth, jump into the warp vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:02:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how it works, Yugi with vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He instantly warps to\Nyour side of the field
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.15,0:02:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near Yugi I think\Nnot maybe you've forgotten Duke
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.77,0:02:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but remember I still have one\Nmore heart point than you do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.77,0:02:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's my turn go dice
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.85,0:02:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the movement crests, I'll\Nbuild a wall around my heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll move\NThunderball into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.59,0:02:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Mighty Mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, Knight of\NTwin Swords. How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The so-called King of Games\Nis in a desperate retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll see how a real master plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use two movement\Ncrests for my crest pull
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to move Orgot the Relentless\Ninto attack range.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,With the magic crests I rolled,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll raise Orgoth's attack power\Nby ten, giving him a total of 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you Orgoth was relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now witness his strength up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth the Relentless, attack\NThunderball and show your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamond Blade Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tough to watch, eh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Devlin's smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Devlin's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolly's stuck in a doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for Thunderball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.69,0:03:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'd better get used\Nto the Taste the Dog Challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just two more monsters left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke's taking out Yugi's\Ndefenses one by one. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi's been in tough spots\Nbefore, and he's always come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.39,0:03:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, he's still got the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You hang in there, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like dual monsters, the game's\Nnot over till the final move is made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't summon any more monsters because\Nthere's no room left in your territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've played well for\Na first-timer, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:04:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way a hack like you\Ncould have beaten the Great Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to expose you\Nas the fraud you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't write that victory\Nspeech just yet, Devlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This game's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dice rolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I checked out my help screen, Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and found Mighty Mage's special ability
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,allows it to attack\Nopponents two spaces away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mighty Mage, lightning staff attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.59,0:04:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries, I can weaken your magic\Nattack with one defense crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth the Relentless, activate defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Orgoth withstood the\Nforce of Mighty Mage's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth only took ten damage points,\Ndropping his hit points to 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But because Orgoth has\Nan attack power of 40,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,my mighty mage took 20 damage points,\Nbut that still leaves 20 hit points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not finished yet, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be, after my next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, go dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance one space, Orgoth\Nthe Relentless! Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth has an attack power of 40,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but his special ability\Nallows me to use six magic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,crest to increase his\Nattack power by 30 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,More than enough to obliterate your mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you should know it takes\Nmore than strength to win, Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Without strategy, power's\Njust an empty threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth, attack mighty mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Diamond Blade Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That leaves me with just one monster\Nstanding between Duke and my heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I get out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your beginner's luck\Nis finally given out, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dungeon Dice Monsters is a different game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just not good\Nenough to beat Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised to get him out of that suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm about to let my best friend down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting my time and surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Yuge, you can't\Nsurrender to that blowhard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This might just won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad, bad dog. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the muzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Muzzle yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something to say here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let Duke rattle you, Yu-Gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been in tougher\Nsituations against better
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,duelists than this guy and\Nyou've always turned it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You even whipped Pegasus, and\Nhe was as crooked as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You won the entire tournament\Nat Duelist Kingdom, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, this is different. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be humble, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You won the championship because you\Nwere the best gamer on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.51,0:06:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.45,0:07:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even better than me and Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All because you believed\Nin the heart of the cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter who your opponent\Nwas or how tough he seemed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that you defeated the\Ninventor of Duel Monsters at his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can beat this joker at his.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let this duke of dork shake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the king of games, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if Dungeon Dice\NMonsters has a few new rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just trust in\Nyourself, you can still win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You taught me that, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's right, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep the faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspiring speech, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can accuse you of\Nrolling over and playing dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you're absolutely right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never forget what made me Duel\NMonsters champion in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,believing in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dungeon Dice Monsters is no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as I have the same faith in\Nmy dice that I had in my dueling deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:07:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.65,0:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd advise you to keep an\Neye on your last heart point,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, because I'm coming after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust in your heart and the\Ndice and you'll never lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit stalling, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a game to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Or to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Go dice roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I use that movement\Ncrest to move my knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, two squares.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,then i'll add four attack crests from\Nmy crest pool to the two attack crests
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,i just rolled giving my knight a\Ntotal of six attack crests orgoth only
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,has a total of five defense crests\Nwith my advantage i should be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,defeat orgoth and go on the offensive\Ni call on the knight of twin swords
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Double slash attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You amateur!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have six attack crests, but\NI have Uronzo's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He can change any crest in\Nmy pool to defense crests,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,which allows him to further\Nshield Orgos from your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth stopped all six of the\NKnight of Twin Swords slash attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say your time's just about up, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few more rolls of the dice, your\Nheart points are going to be history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you see just why they\Ncall Orgoth the Relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth the Relentless, attack\Nthe Knight of Twin Swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Against an attack power as high\Nas Orgoth's, my knight is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:10:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do\Nto protect him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamond Blade, strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your last monster, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now nothing stands in my way. This\Nis gonna be sweet. Duke's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing left to protect my\Nheart points from his final assault
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only one move away from\Nbreaking your heart back it in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it's easy to give up, to\Ngive in when things get tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.79,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's not the way to win
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't quit no matter how hopeless it\Nseems Devlin That's not the way to get
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahead either in Duel Monsters or in life.\NYou know a lot about this game, Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've got a lot to\Nlearn about the people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you play Maybe by the\Ntime this match is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have learned more than\Njust a new dungeon dice rule
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:11:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What you got preach no match\Nthere's nothing I can do this turn
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your philosophy, you're\Nthe one that's about to be schooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch the master rule his dice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more movement, Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I move Orgoth the Relentless two\Nspaces, putting him in attack position.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Orgoth the Relentless, attack\NYugi and his hard points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.87,0:11:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have one hard point left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have one more turn before\NOrgoth destroys your last heart point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'll avenge Pegasus' loss and\Nshow everyone what a phony you are, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't gloat just yet, Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is summon a monster\Nand I can turn this match around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:11:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stream on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.57,0:12:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it sounds simple, but\NI control the field, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any room\Nleft to dimension the dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.59,0:12:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Have faith, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fighting! He's\Nstealing! He's stealing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Millions of gaming fans around\Nthe world are glued to the TV,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.05,0:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting for me to show you up\Nfor the fake you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the moment of truth, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.07,0:12:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know there's still one\Nmonster that can help me win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to believe\Nand call on it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Geist Rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A level four summoning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.21,0:12:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad I've got you so boxed\Nin you can't dimension the dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than one way to\Ndimension the dice, Duke Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.89,0:13:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me how to play my game!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let the dice tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimension the dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, he doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's falling perfectly into alignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.61,0:13:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You've completed the summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and now I summon the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.21,0:13:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.65,0:13:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician has\Nnever failed me, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.69,0:13:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was trust my dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And sure enough, he has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.05,0:13:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I've been underestimating\Nthis kid all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.89,0:13:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he's managed to\Ndimension his favorite monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I have been wrong\Nabout him and Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.15,0:13:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I move the Dark Magician forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use his 40 attack points to\Nbring down Orgoth the Relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.43,0:14:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,With only 20 defense points, Orgoth\Ncouldn't stand up to my powerful magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang that from your ear and\Ndangle it, Dookie boy. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's really beaten\NDuke in his own game now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep smiling, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll make it that much sweeter when\NI take out your last heart point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know the perfect way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your comeback ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.25,0:14:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.49,0:14:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I move the dark assailant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that skull head up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.85,0:14:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when I told you\Nabout item summoning, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like surprises, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you'll be getting one soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark assailant, open the treasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's starting the summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Monster Cannon. Monster\NCannon, what's that thing do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.55,0:15:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it do? It takes\Ndown Yugi's Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Yugi? You've\Nnever heard of the monster Cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad, because if you had,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.35,0:15:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd know that Monster\NCannon is a weapon that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,fires a monster at the enemy\Ninstead of a cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's target, your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.33,0:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Cannon, ready, aim
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Dark Magician's\Nspecial ability now. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:16:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Conceal yourself with magical\Nheads. Feeling lucky, Devlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My mage is under one of these hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but you only have one shot to get it right
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.81,0:16:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your carnival tricks\Nwon't save you this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster cannon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,attack the dark magician underneath\Nthe second hat from the left Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you guessed wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be, he survived
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.87,0:16:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I should thank you, Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,for making the Dark\NMagician's special abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,in this game the same as in Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, retreat to your original square!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician has a\Nfew more special abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.49,0:16:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to strengthen my defense\Nbefore I lose my advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can run, Devlin, but you can't hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use those two magic crests to\Nactivate another special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,by Dark Magician's Mystic Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.81,0:17:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Warp Vortex inspired me to find an\Nalternative path to your side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,By skewering your own monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uranzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your magician switched\Npositions with my monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's in attack position,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's nothing between\Nus to protect my heart points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means he'll deliver the final blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dog magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My dog days are over! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Yugi is the king of games!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.37,0:18:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I'm sorry I accused you of cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The better player won\Ntoday, and it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You proved you really did\Nbeat Pegasus, fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was such a creep today, and thanks to\Nthose TV cameras, the whole world knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My store is ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's going to want to play\NDungeon Dice Monsters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true at all, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.01,0:18:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Dungeon Dice Monsters has\Nthe potential to become a huge hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen a game this\Nexciting since Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to keep your store open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than enough room\Nfor two game stores in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a feeling once Dungeon\NDice Monsters takes off,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.89,0:18:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll both have all the\Ncustomers you can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think so? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.45,0:18:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dice Monsters is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to learn how\Nto play Dice Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can teach you. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Joey's out of the doghouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe things will get back\Nto normal around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that I can finally\Nget back to playing Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.41,0:18:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you let me off so easy, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.75,0:19:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a total jerk to\Nyou and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.23,0:19:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The game is over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.99,0:19:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just leave the\Nfighting on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,because revenge leaves you with\Nnothing except more bad feelings, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're truly sorry, the\Nbest thing to do is be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're offering me\Nsomething better than winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.23,0:19:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship always is. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.99,0:19:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.03,0:19:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you got some new email.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Industrial Illusions did\Nsend a contract after all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and they want to take\NDungeon Dice Monsters Global!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the money now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,now duke congratulations to\Nyou that's great thank you so
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,much yugi i really couldn't have\Ndone it without you setting me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,straight duke you invented a\Ngreat game but you made me see it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:20:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,was missing something that a\Ngame's not just about mastering the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,rules but about getting to know\Nyour opponent right it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,all about rules and how to win\Nit's about having fun and meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and making new friends because\Nyou never know where you're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,find them or once you've met How\Nclose they're going to become.
